      "problem": "$x$ is divisible by $2$ **and** $3.$\n\nExpress the compound predicate above in symbolic form given the following notations:\n\n- $F(x):$ $x$ is divisible by $2$\n\n- $G(x):$ $x$ is divisible by $3$",
